{"status":"FAIL","findings":[{"category":"numerical_scale","severity":"material","narrativeExcerpt":"42,4 van de 605,6 quadriljoen Btu totale energieproductie","evidenceExcerpt":"Across all energy production, renewables were 42.4 out of 605.6 quadrillion Btu, reported as 7%.","explanation":"In Dutch, “quadriljoen” denotes 10^24, whereas the source’s “quadrillion” denotes 10^15. This changes the scale of both energy-production figures by a factor of a billion and materially misstates the data.","findingType":"contradiction","suggestedCorrection":"Use the Dutch equivalent “biljard Btu” for both figures, or retain “quadrillion Btu” to avoid the scale mismatch."}]}

